  "title": "BackerKit at Gen Con 2026",
  "summary": "BackerKit is back for another Gen Con! We can’t wait to dive into four days of tabletop gaming with the crowdfunding community. Find us in Indianapolis July 30 – August 2, at Booth #363 in the exhibit hall. We’ll have demos, playtests, panels, and the return of our fan-favorite Crowdfunding Side Quest activity. See you […] The post BackerKit at Gen Con 2026 appeared first on Crowdfunding Blog & Resources | BackerKit .",
